; The three structural materials bind the registered station panel family at the
; 0.28 m physical scale, matching the Habitat shell the doors are set into, so a
; door frame reads as the same manufactured plate stock as the wall around it
; rather than as flat-shaded trim. Metallic and roughness are also spread much
; further apart than the original 0.30-0.38 band: a cast frame post, a machined
; alloy header and a painted pressure leaf should differ in how they answer a
; light, not only in hue.

